#: ../../source/docs/training-mode.rst:5 7ca7759b5d44476da7fb117e673df211
msgid "TRAINING Mode"
msgstr "Training 模式"

#: ../../source/docs/training-mode.rst:7 79af04d2a1214eb0937a103fd617e9b5
msgid ""
"TRAINING mode is ideal for teaching students manual R/C control. It gives "
"users complete control over the rudder and throttle, but clips the maximum "
"roll and maximum/minimum pitch to certain limits which cannot be exceeded. "
"TRAINING mode also restricts plane roll to the :ref:`Stall Prevention "
"<stall-prevention>` roll limits."
msgstr ""
"Training 模式非常适合教学生手动遥控操作。它让用户完全控制方向舵和油门，但将最大横滚和最大/最小俯仰限制在某些无法超越的范围内。Training"
" 模式还将飞机横滚限制在 :ref:`失速防护 <stall-prevention>` 横滚限制内。"

#: ../../source/docs/training-mode.rst:13 0532bd6e256d49ad94f2718d35d62c64
msgid "More specifically:"
msgstr "更具体地说："

#: ../../source/docs/training-mode.rst:15 bf7fd86db56343f0886d9a63c94863f0
msgid ""
"If the roll is less the :ref:`ROLL_LIMIT_DEG <ROLL_LIMIT_DEG>` parameter "
"than the pilot has manual roll control. If the plane tries to roll past that"
" limit then the roll will be held at that limit. The plane will not "
"automatically roll back to level flight, but it will prevent the pilot from "
"rolling past the limit. The same applies to pitch - the pilot has manual "
"pitch control until the :ref:`PTCH_LIM_MIN_DEG <PTCH_LIM_MIN_DEG>` or "
":ref:`PTCH_LIM_MAX_DEG <PTCH_LIM_MAX_DEG>` limits are reached, at which "
"point the plane won't allow the pitch to go past those limits."
msgstr ""
"如果横滚小于 :ref:`ROLL_LIMIT_DEG <ROLL_LIMIT_DEG>` "
"参数，飞手拥有手动横滚控制。如果飞机尝试超过该限制横滚，横滚将保持在该限制值。飞机不会自动恢复到水平飞行，但会阻止飞手超越该限制。俯仰同理——飞手拥有手动俯仰控制，直到达到"
" :ref:`PTCH_LIM_MIN_DEG <PTCH_LIM_MIN_DEG>` 或 :ref:`PTCH_LIM_MAX_DEG "
"<PTCH_LIM_MAX_DEG>` 限制，此时飞机不允许俯仰超过这些限制。"

#: ../../source/docs/training-mode.rst:24 504ac212c503433db1e6175c60ed1c59
msgid ""
"When turning, the autopilot will monitor the demanded bank angle and "
"airspeed and work out if there is a sufficient margin above the stall speed "
"to turn at the demanded bank angle. If not the bank angle is limited to the "
"safe value. The stall prevention system will always allow a bank of at least"
" 25 degrees (to ensure you can still manoeuvre if your airspeed estimate is "
"badly off)."
msgstr ""
"转弯时，飞控将监测需求倾斜角和空速，并计算是否有足够的失速速度余量以需求的倾斜角转弯。如果没有，倾斜角将被限制在安全值。失速防护系统始终允许至少25度的倾斜角（以确保在空速估计严重偏差时仍能机动）。"

#: ../../source/docs/training-mode.rst:30 5de2775c5d594a3387416077d515d52f
msgid "The rudder and throttle are both completely under manual control."
msgstr "方向舵和油门均完全在手动控制下。"

#: ../../source/docs/training-mode.rst:32 caffc12a15c049a89f99c31a2f78fee9
msgid ""
"the :ref:`MAN_EXPO_ROLL<MAN_EXPO_ROLL>`, "
":ref:`MAN_EXPO_PITCH<MAN_EXPO_PITCH>`, and "
":ref:`MAN_EXPO_RUDDER<MAN_EXPO_RUDDER>` parameters will apply exponential to"
" the stick inputs, if non-zero, in this mode. This is for users with "
"transmitters which do not provide this function and desire to \"soften\" "
"stick feel around neutral."
msgstr ""
":ref:`MAN_EXPO_ROLL<MAN_EXPO_ROLL>`、:ref:`MAN_EXPO_PITCH<MAN_EXPO_PITCH>` 和 "
":ref:`MAN_EXPO_RUDDER<MAN_EXPO_RUDDER>` "
"参数如果非零，将在此模式下对摇杆输入应用指数曲线。这适用于遥控器不提供此功能且希望在中立位置附近「柔化」摇杆手感的用户。"
